  "title": "Aurinia Pharmaceuticals to Host Conference Call to Discuss AUR200 Phase 1 Study Results on June 30, 2025",
  "summary": "ROCKVILLE, Md. & EDMONTON, Alberta – June 29, 2025 – Aurinia Pharmaceuticals Inc. (NASDAQ: AUPH) today announced that it will host a webcast and conference call on June 30, 2025, at 8:30 a.m. ET to discuss AUR200 Phase 1 study results. The link to the webcast is available here. To join the conference call, please dial 877-407-9170/+1 201-493-6756. Click here for participant International Toll-Free access numbers. A replay of the webcast will be available on Aurinia’s website.",
